Subject: [PATCH 2/2] scripts/dtc: Update to upstream version v1.4.7
To: barebox@lists.infradead.org

This commit was generated by running ./scripts/dtc/update-dtc-source.sh
from the otherwise empty directory.

Besides updating to the most recent dtc release (so that /omit-if-no-ref/
becomes available), it reinstates the dtc-lexer.l and
dtc-parser.y files which were erroneously deleted in place of their
pregenerated _shipped.c versions.

Also removed are fdtputc.c and fdtdump.c, which aren't built or used
anywhere.

